      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In May 2023, a 4.5‑year closure of Queen Street between Victoria and Bay Streets began to allow construction of the new Queen station on the Ontario Line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ontario_Line",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Early‑works projects for the Ontario Line began in early 2023 at sites including Queen, Corktown, and Osgoode stations, marking the start of the line’s construction.",
